## Final Discovery

Organizational Learning is the persistent organizational phenomenon through which previous Organizational Outcomes systematically influence future organizational behavior, structures, governance, or capabilities.

Learning is distinct from:

- Governance
- Capability
- Organizational Outcome
- Organizational Change
- Adaptation

Learning provides the mechanism through which organizations evolve based upon organizational experience.

